    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "McCormack Estates are delighted to present No.90 Holywell Wood to the market.\r\n\r\nThis spacious one bedroom ground floor apartment comes to market in excellent condition throughout and is beautifully presented. The property will appeal to a variety of buyers from first time buyers or downsizers to investors, interest is sure to be high in this property.\r\n\r\nInternally the property is in excellent condition throughout. The property comprises of a ground floor entrance, entrance foyer, large open plan living area with kitchen off the living area, a family bathroom, generously sized bedroom with access to the rear West facing balcony which is not overlooked.\r\n\r\nThe area benefits from primary and secondary schools and crèches, Airside retail park, easy access to Swords main street and there are numerous sporting facilities and recreational activities in the area. The M1 motorway is nearby offering easy access throughout the City. The area is also well served with bus routes. There are ample communal parking spaces to the front of the property. Management charges are c.€800 per annum.\r\n\r\n*Please note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
